C FLUSHC              INDICATORS FOR DATA
C
C FLUSHL                 INDICATES DATA ERROR -- RUN IS TO BE FLUSHED
C                        (ORIGINALLY CALLED FLUSH, BUT CONFLICTED WITH
C                        SOME UNIX SYSTEMS ROUTINE)
C HELEM                  TRUE IF ELEMENT IS ONE WHICH CAN BE CONSTRAINED,
C                        STORED, PLOT, OR HISTOGRAMMED (IN TURTLE)
C
      LOGICAL         FLUSHL, HELEM
      COMMON /FLUSHC/ FLUSHL, HELEM
